config LUKEPRIVACY
	bool "Per-UID device identifier compat layer"
	default n
	help
	  Built-in per-UID device-identifier spoofing (SSAID/GAID/sensors/GPS/
	  carrier/MediaDRM/etc.), controlled at runtime via a hidden, root-only
	  /proc control node. Logic is compiled directly into the choke-point
	  kernel functions (binder copy, socket recv, vfs read, stat/statfs,
	  ioctl, evdev) — no loadable module, no runtime hooks. For custom builds.
